          "type": "text",
          "name": "Seating and menu",
          "source": "# Reception checks\n\nConfirmed guests count against each table's capacity. Pending guests have provisional assignments but do not consume a confirmed seat. Resolve any over-capacity status before sharing the seating plan.\n\n{{ HSTACK('Guest list'!Guests[Guest],'Guest list'!Guests[Meal],'Guest list'!Guests[TableName],'Guest list'!Guests[DietaryNotes]) }}"
        },
